            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
              <h2 class="mt-2">About</h2>
              <p>
                Mavnew is a fitness and gym equipment review site. We specialize mostly on exercise bikes and provide tips on how to stay fit and healthy.
                We go into details about the products we review on our platform, informing our viewers of the pros and cons of our promotions, and most especially, why they should use them.
              </p>

